        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Terrible service. My 90-year-old mother-in-law paid 2,000 for a hearing aid, and they didn't show her how to use it. When I called them for instructions in English, they told me, \"Well, madam, we only receive them in French.\" The lack of common sense is astounding.",
