        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "I was very impressed with hearing care professional Ivanie Fortin.\n\nShe thoroughly examined my ears and hearing aids, carefully repaired and tested them, and I can now use them.\nAs my hearing aids are getting old, Ivanie recommended some options and explained how I could use my health insurance, etc. Ivanie was very kind, patient, and extremely helpful.\nI am so glad to have found a professional hearing care professional near me.",
